                <pb facs="0849" n="729" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg729"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Proposed answer to Mr. Stevens</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">by British Minister</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >February, 1905.</hi></head>
                <p>I approve compromise proposed by you, but I am strongly of opinion that removal
                    of Mullah if postponed should not be shirked, and that he should if possible
                    leave before Moharren.</p>
            </div>
